OL,3,GNEWSAMemorial fire aimed at Iranian
OL,4,Aexile, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man carried out an arson attack near
OL,7,Fa memorial wall in north London Green
OL,8,Fto burn a photograph of the former
OL,9,FCrown Prince of Iran who he blamed for
OL,10,Fhis cousin's death, a court has heard.
OL,12,FAli Fallahi, 46, from Ilford, east
OL,13,FLondon, pleaded guilty to arson in
OL,14,FAugust over a fire on 27 April in
OL,15,FGolders Green - an area with a large
OL,16,FJewish population - sparking an
OL,17,Finvestigation by counter-terrorism
OL,18,Fpolice.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
